  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix: resolve 20 repository review findings across research and storage by @iliaal in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1326\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/mark3labs/mcp-go from 1.2.1 to 1.3.0 in /mcp by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1330\n* chore(deps): bump zizmorcore/zizmor-action from 0.6.4 to 0.7.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1331\n* chore(deps): bump google/osv-scanner-action/.github/workflows/osv-scanner-reusable.yml from 2.6.0 to 2.7.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1332\n* chore(deps): bump actions/upload-artifact from 7.0.1 to 7.0.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1333\n* chore(deps): bump github/codeql-action/upload-sarif from 4.38.3 to 4.39.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1334\n* fix(youtube): cap paid transcript rescues at the target and request every -orig track first by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1321\n* fix: don't prescribe a yt-dlp upgrade for a YouTube timeout by @giuseppebisemi in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1327\n* fix: enforce person identity before expansion and ranking by @ElliotDrel in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1325\n* fix(github): distinguish repository metrics from comments by @Navlem in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1329\n* fix(grounding): keep undated keyless web results instead of dropping the whole web lane by @francoislejunk in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1312\n* fix(tiktok): preserve collected videos at the stream deadline by @monsterlag in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1318\n* fix(grok): audit each grok build locally instead of pinning 1.0.46 by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1337\n* fix: return a YouTube lane's videos when it runs out of time by @giuseppebisemi in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1328\n* feat: add Dia to macOS Chromium-family cookie extraction by @arkadevbanerjee in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/929\n* fix(youtube): return YouTube results for every entity in comparisons by @tmchow in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1336\n* fix(instagram): classify ScrapeCreators no-reels 404 as no results by @OKAN-SOFTWARE in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1338\n* refactor(github): replace legacy footer classifier with static fields by @tmchow in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1339\n* feat(reddit): arctic-shift fallback for shreddit comment enrichment by @technicianofthesacred in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/961\n* fix(reddit): stop the arctic comment fallback at the enrichment budget by @tmchow in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1340\n* chore(release): bump version to 3.31.0 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1341\n\n## New Contributors\n* @ElliotDrel made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1325\n* @Navlem made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1329\n* @francoislejunk made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1312\n* @monsterlag made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1318\n* @arkadevbanerjee made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/929\n* @OKAN-SOFTWARE made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1338\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/compare/v3.30.0...v3.31.0",
